B.a2n=new A.aB("Your pay grade, for example E-1 or O-3. Your base pay is set from it.","",null)
B.a1l=new A.aB("The date you entered active duty for pay purposes. Also called your Pay Entry Base Date (PEBD). Printed as year, month, day (YYMMDD).","PEBD = Pay Entry Base Date",null)
B.a2k=new A.aB("How many full years of service count toward your pay.","YRS SVC = Years of Service",null)
B.a1J=new A.aB("Expiration Term of Service. The date your current enlistment or service commitment ends. Also called the Expiration of Active Obligated Service (EAOS).","ETS = Expiration Term of Service; EAOS = Expiration of Active Obligated Service",null)
B.a2m=new A.aB("Which military service you are in: Air Force, Army, Navy or Space Force.","",null)
B.a1j=new A.aB("A code number for the finance office that handles your pay. Each finance office has its own number.","ADSN = Accounting and Disbursing Station Number; DSSN = Disbursing Station Symbol Number",null)
B.a1T=new A.aB("The dates this statement covers, normally one calendar month. On a separation statement, the separation date shows here.","",null)
B.a20=new A.aB("Everything you earned this period: your pay, bonuses, special pays and allowances. There is room for 15 lines; extra lines print in Remarks. Back pay you are owed is added here too.","",null)
B.a1E=new A.aB("Everything in the Entitlements column added together.","",null)
B.a1n=new A.aB("Everything taken out of your pay this period: taxes, life insurance, your mid-month pay and similar items. Check that your marital status and exemptions are right, because they change how much tax is taken.",u.f,null)
B.a2v=new A.aB("Everything in the Deductions column added together.","",null)
B.a1Z=new A.aB("Money you set up to be sent automatically from your pay to someone else or somewhere else, such as a second bank account, an insurer, housing, or child support. Know what each one is for and when it ends. Reserve and National Guard members do not have allotments.","",null)
B.a1X=new A.aB("Who the statement is for and the period it covers: your pay grade, branch of service, pay date, retirement plan, years of service and ETS. Check these first, because the rest of the statement is worked out from them.","",null)
B.a15=new A.aB("Your Thrift Savings Plan (TSP) retirement account: what is taken from your pay each month, split into traditional and Roth, and any matching contribution if you are in the Blended Retirement System. Check it against what you set up in MyPay.","",null)
B.a0z=new A.aB("Everything else the statement prints: your leave balances, housing, and the remarks. Remarks carry notices and explain starts, stops and changes to your pay.","",null)
B.a1h=new A.aB("Everything in the Allotments column added together.","",null)
B.a2B=new A.aB("Money you were owed from your last statement that had not been paid yet.","",null)
B.a1Y=new A.aB("All your pay and allowances for this period added together.","",null)
B.a2b=new A.aB("Everything taken out of your pay this period added together.","",null)
B.a0R=new A.aB("All your allotments added together.","",null)
B.a1A=new A.aB("Amount forward plus total entitlements, minus total deductions and total allotments.","",null)
B.a1G=new A.aB("Pay you are owed but have not been paid yet. It shows as Amount forward on your next statement.","",null)
B.a2t=new A.aB("The actual amount paid to you on the end-of-month payday.","EOM = End of Month",null)
B.a1M=new A.aB("Date Initially Entered Military Service. The date you first joined any military service. It is used only to decide which retirement plan you are under. If it looks wrong, see your personnel office; the finance office (DFAS) does not set this date.","DIEMS = Date Initially Entered Military Service; DFAS = Defense Finance and Accounting Service",null)
B.a0L=new A.aB("Which military retirement plan you are in: Final Pay, High-3, REDUX, CHOICE or Blended. It depends on your DIEMS date and, for some people, a choice they made. Anyone who joined on or after 1 January 2018 is in the Blended plan.","",null)
B.a14=new A.aB("How much of this period\u2019s pay is subject to federal income tax.","",null)
B.a1s=new A.aB("Your pay subject to federal income tax, so far this calendar year.","YTD = Year to Date",null)
B.a1w=new A.aB("Your federal filing status from your IRS Form W-4: M married, S single, H head of household. It sets how much federal tax is taken.","M/S/H = Married / Single / Head of household; IRS = Internal Revenue Service",null)
